  m_Name: SumorDialouge0
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueData
  lines:
  - speakerName: Sumor
    text: "Demek yeni H\xE6rfest sensin. Bu zamana kadar mevsim ruhlar\u0131n\u0131n
      yerlerini ba\u015Fkas\u0131na b\u0131rakt\u0131\u011F\u0131 g\xF6r\xFClmemi\u015Ftir. "
  - speakerName: Sumor
    text: "E\u011Fer bu i\u015Fi eline y\xFCz\xFCne bula\u015Ft\u0131r\u0131rsan
      bir ruhun yanarak \xF6ld\xFC\u011F\xFCne de ilk defa \u015Fahit oluruz.\n"
